  {
   "section": "PageLead",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Assuring integrity in checking compliance"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Consumers have high confidence in Fairtrade and the integrity of our system. In addition to maintaining the Fairtrade Standards for producers and traders, we have a rigorous system for checking that our certifiers and licensing bodies meet certain criteria."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 2,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
    {
     "unitSelector": "DIV.Image",
     "count": 2,
     "unit": {
      "headings": 0,
      "ctas": 0,
      "imgs": 1,
      "textRuns": 0
     },
     "uniform": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "RichtextSection",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "If the Fairtrade Standards are organizations and companies are checked for, the Fairtrade assurance system defines these entities are checked. You can read more about our"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "what"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "how"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "certification processes.",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/us-en/why-fairtrade/how-we-do-it/how-fairtrade-certification-works.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Maintaining the independence, consistency and impartiality of the certification and licensing processes on a global scale is part of our commitment to transparency and the integrity of Fairtrade."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Our assurance system includes a set of rules for how certification and licensing must be done, a way to check compliance with the rules, and a committee with representation of all our stakeholders that decides if the certifiers and licensing bodies continue to meet Fairtrade’s expectations."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Our assurance system was designed following and builds on the requirements of . Additionally FLOCERT, the main independent certifier for Fairtrade, is accredited against ISO17065 by the German national Accreditation Body DAkkS."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "the requirements of ISEAL’s Assurance Code",
     "href": "https://www.isealalliance.org/get-involved/resources/iseal-assurance-code-good-practice"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "ISO17065",
     "href": "http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=46568"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "If you have a complaint or comment to submit to our assurance system please contact us by sending an email to assurance(at)fairtrade.net"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 5,
