  {
   "section": "AccordionSection",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "The following documents outline the process and protocol of our assurance system."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Public system report"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Public system report"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "This is a summarized overview of our assurance system, developed as part of our compliance with ISEAL's Code, that will help readers have a quick understanding of the programme as well as compare it to other schemes"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Global Impact Public systems report",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/global/impact/how-we-measure-impact/Fairtrade-Public-System-Report-Dec-2024.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Assurance and Licensing public system report",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_PublicSystemReport_v2.0_EN.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Oversight Procedure"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Oversight Procedure"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "This document explains how Fairtrade International verifies and ensures that all assurance providers and licensing bodies comply with the assurance system."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Download",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_OversightProcedure_EN.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Exceptions Policy"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Exceptions Policy"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Exceptions Policy: This document defines Fairtrade International's policy regarding exceptions to the Fairtrade Standards and standards-related policies and guidelines."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "EN |"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Exceptions Policy",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_ExceptionsPolicy_EN.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "ES |"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Política de Excepciones de Fairtrade International",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_ExceptionsPolicy_SP.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "FR |"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Politique pour les Exceptions",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_ExceptionsPolicy_FR.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "PT |"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Política de Exceções da Fairtrade International",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_ExceptionsPolicy_PT.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Annual exceptions report"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Annual exceptions report"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "Aggregated annual summary of exceptions from Fairtrade Standards granted by our assurance provider and licensing bodies."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "EN |"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Annual exceptions report 2022",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/standards-documents-as-of-14-11/Public%20Exceptions%20report%202022.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Requirements for Assurance Providers"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Requirements for Assurance Providers"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 28,
     "text": "This document defines the rules that all Fairtrade certifiers must follow when auditing for compliance with the Fairtrade Standards."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "Download",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_ReqAssuranceProviders_EN.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Requirements for Licensing Bodies"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 31,
     "text": "Fairtrade International Requirements for Licensing Bodies"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 32,
     "text": "This document defines the rules that all Fairtrade licensing bodies must follow to ensure that the Fairtrade Marks and claims are adequately and appropriately used."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 33,
     "text": "Download",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_ReqLicensingBodies_EN.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 34,
     "text": "Fairtrade Pilots SOP"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 35,
     "text": "Fairtrade Pilots SOP"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 36,
     "text": "This document defines Fairtrade International’s approach to testing and innovating within the scope of the Fairtrade Scheme."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 37,
     "text": "Download",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_Fairtrade%20Pilots%20SOP_v2.0_EN.pdf"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 38,
     "text": "Fairtrade Recognition SOP"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 39,
     "text": "Fairtrade Recognition SOP"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 40,
     "text": "This document regulates how Fairtrade International will engage with other sustainability schemes, either voluntary or regulatory, in recognition agreements."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 41,
     "text": "Downloads",
     "href": "https://www.fairtrade.net/content/dam/fairtrade/fairtrade-international/assurance/ASSU_Recognition%20SOP_v1.0_EN.pdf"
    }
   ],
